cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalisation, please cite it as below."
title: "Affine crystalline cohomology and de Rham cohomology in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A sorry-free Lean 4 formalisation of the affine comparison between
  crystalline cohomology and PD de Rham cohomology (p nilpotent), built on an
  infinitesimal site whose thickenings have a bounded nilpotence exponent.
type: software
